***conformance tests***

# reset-to-seed
After a `POST /reports` that creates a :Patient: and a `POST /sim/advance` with 600 minutes, `POST /admin/reset` with no body returns `200` with `offsetMinutes` 0, and `GET /patients` then returns exactly the 12 :Patient: items `pat-01` to `pat-12`.
